    "family": "ROBUST_BOUNDARY_STATE_TRANSFER",
    "description": "Estimate each target layer's terminal offset from the public L1-L5 depth interpolation using only the final seven complete KST days of the eligible prefix, then add that fixed offset to the contemporaneous public interpolation throughout the withheld window."
